  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Amara Wanjiru — Veterinarian\r\n\r\nAmara runs a mobile practice, driving between farms to treat livestock from early morning until evening. She types each animal's treatment into a tablet, which saves to the tablet's own drive and uploads to the clinic's cloud records when it has a signal.\r\n\r\n### What's Going Wrong?\r\n* The first two farms are fine. By the third, the tablet is sluggish.\r\n* The screen she can read easily in the morning is too dim to read in the afternoon sun.\r\n* Records she enters after lunch don't reach the clinic until the next day.\r\n* By the last farm of the day, the tablet has shut itself down.",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true",
